-- search_path (see each capture site), so search-path-dependent
-- qualification drift between the shadow schemas and the live public/storage
-- schemas cannot create false failures; only the shadow-schema prefix itself
-- is mapped to its live-schema equivalent, deterministically, after deparse.
-- expected_policy_catalog is itself populated only from the 190 accepted
-- source expressions (via CREATE POLICY on shadow tables), so this does not
-- derive expected policy meaning from live state.
